#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:1
msgid "MAC 层详解"
msgstr "MAC Layer Details"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:3
msgid ""
"本文详细解释 SparkLink SLE 数据链路层 (MAC 层) 的设计与实现, "
"涵盖广播与发现、接入流程、链路管理状态机、帧结构与信令编解码、QoS 管理和时序调度, 对标 TXS-10002-2025 标准第 7 章。"
msgstr "This document explains the design and implementation of the SparkLink SLE data link layer (MAC layer), covering broadcast and discovery, access procedures, link management state machines, frame structure and signaling codec, QoS management, and timing scheduling, cross-referenced against Chapter 7 of TXS-10002-2025."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:5
msgid "广播与发现 (§7.1.1-7.1.2)"
msgstr "Broadcast and Discovery (§7.1.1-7.1.2)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:7
msgid "广播是 SLE 建立通信的起点。G 节点周期性发送广播帧, T 节点通过扫描接收这些帧来发现附近的设备。"
msgstr "Broadcasting is the starting point for SLE communication. The G node periodically transmits broadcast frames; T nodes scan these frames to discover nearby devices."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:9
msgid "广播帧的两级结构"
msgstr "Two-Level Broadcast Frame Structure"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:11
msgid "SLE 广播帧分为两级:"
msgstr "SLE broadcast frames have two levels:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:13
msgid "**基础广播帧**: 使用 FT1 或 FT4 帧类型, 在 1 至 3 个广播信道上依次发送 3 次"
msgstr "**Basic broadcast frame**: uses FT1 or FT4 frame type, transmitted 3 times sequentially on 1 to 3 broadcast channels"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:14
msgid "**扩展广播帧**: 紧随基础广播帧之后发送, 间隔不小于 300 $\\mu$s, 携带更多信息"
msgstr "**Extended broadcast frame**: sent immediately after the basic broadcast frame with a minimum gap of 300 $\\mu$s, carrying additional information"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:16
msgid "基础广播帧提供设备发现所需的最少信息, 扩展广播帧则指示接入资源、传输参数、系统管理帧配置等详细内容。"
msgstr "The basic broadcast frame provides the minimum information required for device discovery; the extended broadcast frame indicates access resources, transmission parameters, System Management Frame configuration, and other details."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:18
msgid "广播帧数据类型"
msgstr "Broadcast Frame Data Types"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:20
msgid "广播帧内部由多个子信息条目组成, 每个条目包含类型索引和载荷, 标准定义了 11 种数据类型:"
msgstr "A broadcast frame consists of multiple sub-info entries, each containing a type index and payload. The standard defines 11 data types:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "索引"
msgstr "Index"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "名称"
msgstr "Name"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "用途"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "0x00"
msgstr "0x00"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "发现接入资源配置"
msgstr "Discovery access resource configuration"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "指示可用的接入资源时隙"
msgstr "Indicates available access resource slots"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "0x01"
msgstr "0x01"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "传输指示信息"
msgstr "Transmission indication information"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "首次调度点参数 (58B)"
msgstr "First scheduling point parameters (58B)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "0x02"
msgstr "0x02"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "接入基本信息"
msgstr "Basic access information"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "设备能力和接入参数 (5B)"
msgstr "Device capability and access parameters (5B)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "0x03"
msgstr "0x03"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "接入请求信息"
msgstr "Access request information"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "T 节点发出的连接请求"
msgstr "Connection request from T node"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "0x04"
msgstr "0x04"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "接入响应信息"
msgstr "Access response information"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "G 节点回复的连接结果"
msgstr "Connection result replied by G node"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "0x05"
msgstr "0x05"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "启动系统管理帧信息"
msgstr "Start System Management Frame information"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "SMF 资源配置"
msgstr "SMF resource configuration"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "0x06"
msgstr "0x06"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "非链接态广播链路信息"
msgstr "Non-connected state broadcast link information"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "无连接广播参数 (70B)"
msgstr "Connectionless broadcast parameters (70B)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "0x07"
msgstr "0x07"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "查询请求过滤信息"
msgstr "Query request filter information"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "服务发现过滤条件"
msgstr "Service discovery filter conditions"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "0x08"
msgstr "0x08"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "窄带跳频测量配置"
msgstr "Narrowband frequency hopping measurement configuration"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "窄带定位参数"
msgstr "Narrowband positioning parameters"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "0x09"
msgstr "0x09"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "UWB 脉冲测量配置"
msgstr "UWB pulse measurement configuration"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "超宽带定位参数"
msgstr "UWB positioning parameters"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "0xFF"
msgstr "0xFF"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "高层广播数据"
msgstr "Upper-layer broadcast data"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md
msgid "应用自定义数据"
msgstr "Application-defined data"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:36
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.broadcast` 模块定义了 `BroadcastDataType` 枚举和 21 种子信息数据类, 包括 "
"`ExtAdvResourceConfig`, `DiscoveryAccessResourceConfig`, "
"`AccessBasicInfo` 等, 每个类实现 `pack()`/`unpack()` 方法。`BroadcastFrame` "
"封装了广播帧的整体编解码。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: The `mac.broadcast` module defines the `BroadcastDataType` enum and 21 sub-information data classes, including `ExtAdvResourceConfig`, `DiscoveryAccessResourceConfig`, `AccessBasicInfo`, etc.; each class implements `pack()`/`unpack()`. `BroadcastFrame` encapsulates the overall broadcast frame encoding/decoding."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:38
msgid "发现流程 (§7.1.2)"
msgstr "Discovery Procedure (§7.1.2)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:40
msgid "发现设备 (T 节点) 监听基础广播帧和扩展广播帧, 从中提取设备信息。可选的主动查询流程:"
msgstr "Discovering devices (T nodes) listen to basic and extended broadcast frames to extract device information. Optional active query procedure:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:42
msgid "T 节点发送查询请求帧 (携带过滤信息)"
msgstr "T node sends query request frame (with filter information)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:43
msgid "G 节点回复查询响应帧"
msgstr "G node replies with query response frame"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:45
msgid "**代码实现**: `mac.access.DiscoveryManager` 管理发现流程, 维护已发现设备列表。"
msgstr "**Code implementation**: `mac.access.DiscoveryManager` manages the discovery procedure and maintains the discovered device list."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:47
msgid "广播帧过滤 (§7.1.5)"
msgstr "Broadcast Frame Filtering (§7.1.5)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:49
msgid "接收端可配置过滤规则, 只接收满足条件的广播帧, 支持按地址、接入类型等条件过滤。"
msgstr "The receiver can configure filtering rules to accept only broadcast frames meeting certain conditions, supporting filtering by address, access type, etc."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:51
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.broadcast.BroadcastFilter`, 使用 `FilterCondition` 和 "
"`FilterOp` 定义规则。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: `mac.broadcast.BroadcastFilter`, using `FilterCondition` and `FilterOp` to define rules."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:53
msgid "接入流程 (§7.1.3)"
msgstr "Access Procedure (§7.1.3)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:55
msgid "接入是 T 节点与 G 节点建立连接的过程, 分为以下步骤:"
msgstr "Access is the process by which a T node establishes a connection with a G node, and proceeds in the following steps:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:71
msgid "接入请求携带 GT 角色偏好, G 节点根据自身策略决定是否接受, 以及最终的角色分配。"
msgstr "The access request carries GT role preferences; the G node decides whether to accept and determines the final role assignment based on its own policy."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:73
msgid "角色协商"
msgstr "Role Negotiation"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:75
msgid "GT 角色协商有四种结果:"
msgstr "GT role negotiation has four outcomes:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:77
msgid "**协商 T 节点**: 接受请求, 发起方为 T"
msgstr "**Negotiate T node**: accept request, initiator becomes T"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:78
msgid "**协商 G 节点**: 接受请求, 发起方为 G"
msgstr "**Negotiate G node**: accept request, initiator becomes G"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:79
msgid "**固定 T 节点**: 强制分配为 T"
msgstr "**Fixed T node**: forcibly assigned as T"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:80
msgid "**固定 G 节点**: 强制分配为 G"
msgstr "**Fixed G node**: forcibly assigned as G"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:82
msgid "接入白名单 (§7.1.6)"
msgstr "Access Whitelist (§7.1.6)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:84
msgid "G 节点可配置地址白名单, 仅允许已知设备接入。白名单基于地址匹配, 支持动态添加/删除。"
msgstr "The G node can configure an address whitelist to allow only known devices to access. The whitelist is based on address matching and supports dynamic add/remove."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:86
msgid "**代码实现**: `mac.access` 模块提供两个管理器:"
msgstr "**Code implementation**: the `mac.access` module provides two managers:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:88
msgid "`BroadcasterAccessManager`: G 节点侧, 发送广播、处理请求、发送响应"
msgstr "`BroadcasterAccessManager`: G node side, sends broadcasts, handles requests, sends responses"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:89
msgid "`InitiatorAccessManager`: T 节点侧, 发送请求、处理响应"
msgstr "`InitiatorAccessManager`: T node side, sends requests, handles responses"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:90
msgid "`AccessWhitelist`: 地址白名单"
msgstr "`AccessWhitelist`: address whitelist"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:91
msgid ""
"`AccessPhase` 枚举: IDLE → ADV_SENDING → REQ_WINDOW → RSP_WINDOW → "
"LINK_SETUP → COMPLETED"
msgstr "`AccessPhase` enum: IDLE → ADV_SENDING → REQ_WINDOW → RSP_WINDOW → LINK_SETUP → COMPLETED"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:93
msgid "关键时序约束: 广播帧到扩展广播帧间隔不小于 300 $\\mu$s, 扩展广播帧到接入请求间隔不小于 300 $\\mu$s。"
msgstr "Key timing constraints: the interval from broadcast frame to extended broadcast frame must be at least 300 $\\mu$s; the interval from extended broadcast frame to access request must be at least 300 $\\mu$s."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:95
msgid "链路管理状态机 (§7.1/7.2)"
msgstr "Link Management State Machine (§7.1/7.2)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:97
msgid "链路管理器 (`LinkManager`) 是 MAC 层的核心组件, 通过事件驱动的有限状态机管理链路完整生命周期。"
msgstr "The link manager (`LinkManager`) is the core component of the MAC layer, managing the complete link lifecycle through an event-driven finite state machine."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:99
msgid "状态定义"
msgstr "State Definitions"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:115
msgid "8 种状态:"
msgstr "8 states:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "状态"
msgstr "State"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "IDLE"
msgstr "IDLE"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "空闲, 未参与任何通信"
msgstr "Idle, not participating in any communication"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "BROADCASTING"
msgstr "BROADCASTING"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "G 节点正在发送广播帧"
msgstr "G node is transmitting broadcast frames"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "SCANNING"
msgstr "SCANNING"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "T 节点正在扫描广播"
msgstr "T node is scanning for broadcasts"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "ACCESSING"
msgstr "ACCESSING"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "正在执行接入流程"
msgstr "Executing access procedure"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "CONNECTED"
msgstr "CONNECTED"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "链路已建立, 可收发数据"
msgstr "Link established, can transmit/receive data"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "PAIRING"
msgstr "PAIRING"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "正在执行安全配对"
msgstr "Executing security pairing"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "DORMANT"
msgstr "DORMANT"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "休眠状态 (§7.2.14)"
msgstr "Sleep state (§7.2.14)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "DISCONNECTED"
msgstr "DISCONNECTED"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "链路已断开"
msgstr "Link disconnected"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:128
msgid "事件类型"
msgstr "Event Types"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:130
msgid "状态机接收 21 种事件驱动状态转移, 主要类别:"
msgstr "The state machine processes 21 event types driving state transitions, in these main categories:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:132
msgid "**广播/发现**: 启动/停止广播和扫描, 接收广播帧"
msgstr "**Broadcast/discovery**: start/stop broadcast and scan, receive broadcast frames"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:133
msgid "**接入**: 发送/接收请求和响应"
msgstr "**Access**: send/receive requests and responses"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:134
msgid "**信令**: 收发链路控制信令"
msgstr "**Signaling**: send/receive link control signaling"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:135
msgid "**配对**: 启动配对、完成、失败"
msgstr "**Pairing**: initiate pairing, completion, failure"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:136
msgid "**断开**: 主动断开请求、对端断开、监督超时"
msgstr "**Disconnect**: active disconnect request, peer disconnect, supervision timeout"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:137
msgid "**休眠**: 休眠请求、唤醒请求、唤醒接收"
msgstr "**Sleep**: sleep request, wake request, wake reception"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:139
msgid "链路参数"
msgstr "Link Parameters"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:141
msgid "`LinkParams` 保存当前链路运行参数:"
msgstr "`LinkParams` stores the current link operating parameters:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:143
msgid "收发间隔 (interval_us)"
msgstr "transceive interval (interval_us)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:144
msgid "最大数据长度 (max_data_length)"
msgstr "Maximum data length (max_data_length)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:145
msgid "跳频表 (hop_table)"
msgstr "Hopping table (hop_table)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:146
msgid "帧类型 (frame_type)"
msgstr "Frame type (frame_type)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:147
msgid "CRC 长度 (crc_len)"
msgstr "CRC length (crc_len)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:148
msgid "监督超时 (supervision_timeout_ms)"
msgstr "Supervision timeout (supervision_timeout_ms)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:150
msgid "这些参数可通过控制面流程 (§7.2.1-7.2.25) 动态更新。"
msgstr "These parameters can be dynamically updated via control plane procedures (§7.2.1-7.2.25)."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:152
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.link_manager.LinkManager` 类, 提供 `process_event(Event)` "
"方法驱动状态转移, 通过 `LinkManagerCallback` 接口向上层通知状态变化。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: The `mac.link_manager.LinkManager` class drives state transitions via `process_event(Event)` and notifies the upper layer through the `LinkManagerCallback` interface."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:154
msgid "控制面流程 (§7.2)"
msgstr "Control Plane Procedures (§7.2)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:156
msgid "标准定义了 25 种控制面流程, 全部支持 G 节点和 T 节点双向发起:"
msgstr "The standard defines 25 control plane procedures, all supporting bidirectional initiation by G and T nodes:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:158
msgid "链路参数更新 (§7.2.1-7.2.2)"
msgstr "Link Parameter Update (§7.2.1-7.2.2)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:160
msgid "**收发间隔更新**: 请求→接受/拒绝 或 直接更新"
msgstr "**transceive interval update**: request → accept/reject or direct update"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:161
msgid "**多级收发间隔**: 支持在不同优先级间切换间隔参数"
msgstr "**Multi-level transceive interval**: supports switching interval parameters between different priorities"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:163
msgid "链路能力协商 (§7.2.4-7.2.6)"
msgstr "Link Capability Negotiation (§7.2.4-7.2.6)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:165
msgid "**特性交互**: 交换双方支持的功能特性位图"
msgstr "**Feature exchange**: exchange capability feature bitmaps supported by both sides"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:166
msgid "**版本交互**: 交换协议版本信息"
msgstr "**Version exchange**: exchange protocol version information"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:167
msgid "**数据长度更新**: 协商最大 PDU 长度"
msgstr "**Data length update**: negotiate maximum PDU length"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:169
msgid "信道管理 (§7.2.7-7.2.12)"
msgstr "Channel Management (§7.2.7-7.2.12)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:171
msgid "**信道质量上报**: 配置信道质量汇报周期和方式"
msgstr "**Channel quality reporting**: configure channel quality reporting period and method"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:172
msgid "**跳频表更新**: 更新跳频频点序列"
msgstr "**Hopping table update**: update frequency hopping sequence"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:173
msgid "**跳频地图更新**: 更新信道可用性位图"
msgstr "**Hopping map update**: update channel availability bitmap"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:174
msgid "**最少可用信道**: 确保可用信道数不低于门限"
msgstr "**Minimum available channels**: ensure available channel count does not fall below threshold"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:175
msgid "**CRC 切换**: 在 CRC24 和 CRC32 之间切换"
msgstr "**CRC switching**: switch between CRC24 and CRC32"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:176
msgid "**物理层更新**: 切换帧类型或调制参数"
msgstr "**Physical layer update**: switch frame type or modulation parameters"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:178
msgid "连接管理 (§7.2.13-7.2.17)"
msgstr "Connection Management (§7.2.13-7.2.17)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:180
msgid "**功率控制**: 请求→响应→调整发射功率 (§7.2.13)"
msgstr "**Power control**: request → response → adjust transmit power (§7.2.13)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:181
msgid "**休眠与唤醒**: 一方请求进入休眠, 对方确认; 唤醒时反向操作 (§7.2.14)"
msgstr "**Sleep and wake**: one side requests sleep, other confirms; reverse for wake (§7.2.14)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:182
msgid "**角色切换**: G/T 角色互换 (§7.2.15)"
msgstr "**Role switching**: G/T role swap (§7.2.15)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:183
msgid "**PING 流程**: 检测链路连通性 (§7.2.16)"
msgstr "**PING procedure**: detect link connectivity (§7.2.16)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:184
msgid "**链路断开**: 发送断开指示, 释放资源 (§7.2.17)"
msgstr "**Link disconnect**: send disconnect indication, release resources (§7.2.17)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:186
msgid "高级链路管理 (§7.2.18-7.2.25)"
msgstr "Advanced Link Management (§7.2.18-7.2.25)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:188
msgid "**链接态异步链路**: 参数重配置/更新/建链/断链 (§7.2.18)"
msgstr "**Connected asynchronous link**: parameter reconfiguration/update/setup/teardown (§7.2.18)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:189
msgid "**同步等时链路**: 建链/参数交互/参数更新 (§7.2.19)"
msgstr "**Synchronous isochronous link**: setup/parameter exchange/parameter update (§7.2.19)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:190
msgid "**广播链路**: 建立/参数更新/跳频地图/断开 (§7.2.20)"
msgstr "**Broadcast link**: establishment/parameter update/hopping map/disconnect (§7.2.20)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:191
msgid "**系统管理帧链路**: 参数/时间片更新/信道状态 (§7.2.21)"
msgstr "**System management frame link**: parameters/time slot update/channel status (§7.2.21)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:192
msgid "**异步组播链路**: 建立/参数/断开/超时 (§7.2.22)"
msgstr "**Asynchronous multicast link**: establishment/parameters/disconnect/timeout (§7.2.22)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:193
msgid "**窄带/UWB 测量与感知**: 测量和感知流程管理 (§7.2.23-7.2.25)"
msgstr "**Narrowband/UWB measurement and sensing**: measurement and sensing procedure management (§7.2.23-7.2.25)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:195
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.link_manager.LinkManager` 内部对全部 25 种流程提供处理逻辑, 通过 "
"`mac.link_control` 模块的 109 种信令类型驱动。`mac.power_control` 独立实现功率控制的 3 种信令。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: `mac.link_manager.LinkManager` provides handling logic for all 25 procedures internally, driven by 109 signaling types from `mac.link_control`. `mac.power_control` independently implements 3 power control signaling types."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:197
msgid "帧结构 (§7.3)"
msgstr "Frame Structure (§7.3)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:199
msgid "MAC 帧分为三种:"
msgstr "MAC frames are divided into three types:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:201
msgid "控制面帧 (§7.3.2)"
msgstr "Control Plane Frame (§7.3.2)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:210
msgid "数据类型索引标识信令类型 (130 种), 数据长度指示载荷字节数。"
msgstr "The data type index identifies the signaling type (130 types); data length indicates the payload byte count."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:212
msgid "数据面帧 (§7.3.3)"
msgstr "Data Plane Frame (§7.3.3)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:214
msgid "**异步数据帧** (§7.3.3.2):"
msgstr "**Asynchronous data frame** (§7.3.3.2):"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:223
msgid "分段标志 (SegmentType): COMPLETE / FIRST / MIDDLE / LAST, 支持将大 PDU 分段传输。"
msgstr "Segmentation flag (SegmentType): COMPLETE / FIRST / MIDDLE / LAST, supporting large PDU segmented transmission."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:225
msgid "**同步数据帧** (§7.3.3.3): 增加 PDU 序号、事件组编号和时间偏移字段, 适用于等时传输。"
msgstr "**Synchronous data frame** (§7.3.3.3): adds PDU sequence number, event group number, and time offset fields, suitable for isochronous transmission."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:227
msgid "复用帧 (§7.3.4)"
msgstr "Multiplex Frame (§7.3.4)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:229
msgid "复用帧允许在单个物理帧中同时携带控制面数据和用户面数据:"
msgstr "Multiplex frames allow control plane data and user plane data to be carried simultaneously in a single physical frame:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:238
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.frame` 模块定义 `ControlFrame`, `AsyncDataFrame`, "
"`SyncDataFrame`, `MuxFrame`, 各有 `pack()`/`unpack()` 方法。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: The `mac.frame` module defines `ControlFrame`, `AsyncDataFrame`, `SyncDataFrame`, `MuxFrame`, each with `pack()`/`unpack()` methods."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:240
msgid "信令编解码 (§7.3)"
msgstr "Signaling Encode/Decode (§7.3)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:242
msgid "SLE 数据链路层共注册了 **130 种信令类型**:"
msgstr "The SLE data link layer registers a total of **130 signaling types**:"

