msgstr "0x0133-0x0149"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "`mac.security`"
msgstr "`mac.security`"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:250
msgid ""
"每种信令都是一个数据类, 包含 `DATA_TYPE_INDEX`、`BYTE_LENGTH`、字段定义和 `pack()`/`unpack()`"
" 方法。"
msgstr "Each signaling type is a data class containing `DATA_TYPE_INDEX`, `BYTE_LENGTH`, field definitions, and `pack()`/`unpack()` methods."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:252
msgid "信令注册表 (`mac.signaling`) 维护索引到类的映射, 提供统一的编解码接口:"
msgstr "The signaling registry (`mac.signaling`) maintains an index-to-class mapping, providing a unified encode/decode interface:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:254
msgid "`encode_signaling(msg)` → 序列化为 `ControlFrame`"
msgstr "`encode_signaling(msg)` → serialize to `ControlFrame`"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:255
msgid "`decode_signaling(frame)` → 从 `ControlFrame` 解析出具体信令对象"
msgstr "`decode_signaling(frame)` → parse a specific signaling object from `ControlFrame`"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:257
msgid "QoS 管理 (§6.5)"
msgstr "QoS Management (§6.5)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:259
msgid "QoS 管理器保障数据传输的可靠性和效率:"
msgstr "The QoS manager ensures data transmission reliability and efficiency:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:261
msgid "ARQ 自动重传"
msgstr "ARQ Automatic Retransmission"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:263
msgid "序列号管理和重传控制。不同帧类型的模数不同:"
msgstr "Sequence number management and retransmission control. Different frame types have different moduli:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "帧类型"
msgstr "Frame Type"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "SN 模数"
msgstr "SN Modulus"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "FT1"
msgstr "FT1"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "FT2"
msgstr "FT2"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "FT3/FT4"
msgstr "FT3/FT4"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:101
msgid "32"
msgstr "32"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:271
msgid "HARQ 混合重传"
msgstr "HARQ Hybrid Retransmission"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:273
msgid "支持两种反馈模式:"
msgstr "Supports two feedback modes:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:275
msgid "**TB (传输块)**: 整个传输块 ACK/NACK"
msgstr "**TB (transport block)**: ACK/NACK for the entire transport block"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:276
msgid "**CBG (码块组)**: 按码块组粒度反馈, 部分重传 (最多 8 个 CBG)"
msgstr "**CBG (code block group)**: feedback at code block group granularity, partial retransmission (up to 8 CBGs)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:278
msgid "流控"
msgstr "Flow Control"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:280
msgid "基于信用额度的发送窗口控制, 防止发送端淹没接收端。"
msgstr "Credit-based transmit window control, preventing the sender from overwhelming the receiver."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:282
msgid "链路质量跟踪"
msgstr "Link Quality Tracking"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:284
msgid "实时统计帧错误率 (FER), 计算推荐 MCS 索引, 支持自适应调制编码 (AMC)。"
msgstr "Real-time frame error rate (FER) statistics, computing recommended MCS index, supporting adaptive modulation and coding (AMC)."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:286
msgid "优先级队列"
msgstr "Priority Queue"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:288
msgid "五级优先级: CONTROL > REALTIME > HIGH > NORMAL > LOW, 高优先级载荷优先发送。"
msgstr "Five priority levels: CONTROL > REALTIME > HIGH > NORMAL > LOW; higher priority payloads are sent first."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:290
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.qos.QosManager` 整合 `ArqState`, `HarqController`, "
"`FlowController`, `LinkQualityTracker`, `TxQueue`。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: `mac.qos.QosManager` integrates `ArqState`, `HarqController`, `FlowController`, `LinkQualityTracker`, and `TxQueue`."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:292
msgid "时序调度 (§6.3/6.6)"
msgstr "Timing Scheduling (§6.3/6.6)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:294
msgid "超帧结构"
msgstr "Superframe Structure"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:296
msgid ""
"SLE 时序由超帧 (Superframe) 组织, 两个系统管理帧 (SMF) 之间为一个超帧周期。超帧内部划分为多个时间片 "
"(TimeSlice), 每个时间片分配给特定链路。"
msgstr "SLE timing is organized by superframes (Superframe); the period between two system management frames (SMF) constitutes one superframe cycle. Each superframe is subdivided into multiple time slices (TimeSlice), each assigned to a specific link."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:298
msgid "系统管理帧 (§6.6)"
msgstr "System Management Frame (§6.6)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:300
msgid "SMF 是 G 节点向所有 T 节点广播的调度信息帧, 包含:"
msgstr "SMF is the scheduling information frame broadcast by the G node to all T nodes, containing:"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:302
msgid "**调度信令**: 时间片分配和链路调度"
msgstr "**Scheduling signaling**: time slot allocation and link scheduling"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:303
msgid "**链路信令**: 链路参数更新通知"
msgstr "**Link signaling**: link parameter update notification"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:304
msgid "**偏移信令**: 时间偏移校正"
msgstr "**Offset signaling**: time offset correction"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:306
msgid "SMF 发送调度由 `mac.smf_scheduler.SMFTransmitScheduler` 管理。"
msgstr "SMF transmission scheduling is managed by `mac.smf_scheduler.SMFTransmitScheduler`."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:308
msgid "事件组 (§附录 D)"
msgstr "Event Groups (§Appendix D)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:310
msgid "事件组将多个传输事件组合为一组, 用于等时场景的同步调度。"
msgstr "Event groups combine multiple transmission events into a group for synchronous scheduling in isochronous scenarios."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:312
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.scheduler.ScheduleManager` 管理超帧、事件组和多级收发间隔, `mac.smf` 模块负责"
" SMF 帧的编解码, `mac.smf_scheduler` 负责发送调度。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: `mac.scheduler.ScheduleManager` manages superframes, event groups, and multi-level transceive intervals; `mac.smf` handles SMF frame encoding/decoding; `mac.smf_scheduler` manages transmission scheduling."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:314
msgid "非链接态广播 (§7.1.7)"
msgstr "Non-Connected State Broadcast (§7.1.7)"

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:316
msgid "设备之间无需建立连接即可进行数据广播, 适用于周期性公告信息等场景。非链接态广播帧使用独立的参数配置, 与有连接的数据传输互不干扰。"
msgstr "Devices can broadcast data without establishing a connection, suitable for periodic announcement scenarios. Non-connected state broadcast frames use independent parameter configurations and do not interfere with connected data transmission."

#: ../../explanation/mac-layer.md:318
msgid ""
"**代码实现**: `mac.access.NonConnectedBroadcastManager`, 配合 "
"`NonConnectedBroadcastConfig` 使用。"
msgstr "**Implementation**: `mac.access.NonConnectedBroadcastManager`, used together with `NonConnectedBroadcastConfig`."

